---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
const {} = Astro.props;
---

<p class="contact-description">
	Have your own idea for a project? Let's brainstorm how we can bring it to life.
	<br/><br/>
	Interested in one of our pre-made projects? Let us know, and we can help you hit the ground running.
	<br/><br/>
	Fill out the form or send us an email.
</p>

<div class="contact-info">
	<div class="contact-item">
		<Icon class="contact-icon" name="uil:map-marker" />
		<span>Time Zone: East Coast, USA</span>
	</div>
	<div class="contact-item">
		<Icon class="contact-icon" name="uil:envelope" />

		<a href="mailto:contact@interzone-tech.com">contact@interzone-tech.com</a>
	</div>
</div>